  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/07/IMG_9706.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Aquest diumenge, 28 de juliol, al Sal&oacute; de Plens de l&rsquo;Ajuntament de Suera s&#39;ha fet el nomenament de les festeres i els festers infantils 2019: Abril Mart&iacute; Oset (de blau) i Carles Mart&iacute; Oset (amb camisa), i Estela Gimeno Pallar&eacute;s (de rosa) i Edgar Moliner Ramos (amb polo).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9659.jpg\" alt=\"img_9659\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9662.jpg\" alt=\"img_9662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9663.jpg\" alt=\"img_9663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9665.jpg\" alt=\"img_9665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9667.jpg\" alt=\"img_9667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9668.jpg\" alt=\"img_9668\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9670.jpg\" alt=\"img_9670\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilssuera/img_9673.jpg\" alt=\"img_9673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentfesteresinfantilss